## The Kitchen

@narrator: The kitchen is warm and loud with a kettle about to sing.
@cook: If you're here about that spoon, I've been at the oven all afternoon.

<hub id="askCook" prompt="What do you ask Mrs. Dunn?">
  <choice id="oven" label="Ask what she was baking" once into="run.tastedCake">
    @cook: Seed cake. The vicar's favourite.
  </choice>
  <choice id="scullery" label="Peek into the scullery" once>
    @narrator: A tray of washed spoons. Five of them.
    ::set{ run.cluesFound += 1 }
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" label="Thank her and go" exit>
    @cook: Mind the step.
  </choice>
</hub>
